PHASE # 1
  
Job board: working keyword/location search, accurate job counts, and empty-result messages.
Job details: each job shows its own information, both inline and on a separate page.
Login/register: candidate-focused forms, password visibility controls, validation, and guest browsing.
Admin: Jobs, Companies, and Applications tabs; temporary job creation/editing/archiving; application evidence review and status changes.
Application Studio: contact details, optional resume and Proof Packs, plus an editable review step.
Code structure: reusable navbar, footer, cards, and details; separate sample data and page scripts.
Usability: keyboard focus indicators, small-screen adjustments, and reduced-motion support.
Project setup: preview command, README, frontend roadmap, and three passing tests.
